\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796310/extras/c2097df64028dc1baa9219e17924da5f.webm?t=1729922557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796310/extras/c2097df64028dc1baa9219e17924da5f.mp4?t=1729922557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ghost, the settings, the events, the lore are all based on real Indonesian culture. You\u2019ll learn all the weird and bizarre culture that shapes the horror itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Get ready to face your fears, with friends or on your own. Choose your character, make decisions, and uncover the mysteries lurking in the darkness. The horror awaits...</i></h2>",
